{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39834","headline":"赠战将 · 殷文圭","name":"赠战将","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿沈枪利雪峰尖，犀甲军装称紫髯。\n威慑万人长凛凛，礼延羣客每谦谦。\n阵前战马黄金勒，架上兵书白玉签。\n不爲已爲儒弟子，好依门下学韬钤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}